      "range": "643-659",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "59堂课后你也能变身语法小达人！",
      "totalCount": 1056
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 267737339,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_71_1653-1746",
      "chapterUid": 71,
      "range": "1653-1746",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "大部分复数名词后面通常要加s或es，显示出数目有两个及以上，不过有些名词有特殊规则，例如词尾已经是s，必须再加上es；词尾是y就要去y改成ies；词尾是f或fe，要去f、fe改成ves。",
      "totalCount": 912
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 72084928,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_70_887-947",
      "chapterUid": 70,
      "range": "887-947",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "中文和英文最大的差别在于中文可以省略“一个”。例如，“我是女孩”，英文一定要说“我是一个女孩”，这点要请大家特别注意喔！",
      "totalCount": 585
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 394470075,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_80_2721-2737",
      "chapterUid": 80,
      "range": "2721-2737",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "学了这么多，你该为自己感到骄傲！",
      "totalCount": 558
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 294970182,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_67_365-448",
      "chapterUid": 67,
      "range": "365-448",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "对于很多人来说，英文学习永远都像是一锅烧不开的水，耗费十几年的时间与金钱，通常只是为了考试时选出4个选项里的正确答案，或填对一格漏字，却不代表有能力完整说出整句英语。",
      "totalCount": 550
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 331297645,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_72_1031-1059",
      "chapterUid": 72,
      "range": "1031-1059",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "形容词通常放在名词的前面，用来描述“名词”的外观或状态。",
      "totalCount": 540
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 437837635,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_90_3040-3064",
      "chapterUid": 90,
      "range": "3040-3064",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "无生命的所有格写法=“部分”属于(of)“全部”",
      "totalCount": 504
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 255293443,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_99_1886-2065",
      "chapterUid": 99,
      "range": "1886-2065",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "可数名词：大多要保持外表完整，通常不可拿刀切开。（猫、狗、苹果、巴士）不可数名词：通常外表较不具体，所以拿刀切开后，本质不变。（时间、水、钱）",
      "totalCount": 420
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 39213517,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_73_2948-2954",
      "chapterUid": 73,
      "range": "2948-2954",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我是高的吗？",
      "totalCount": 384
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 915042270,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_86_7462-7526",
      "chapterUid": 86,
      "range": "7462-7526",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“在树上”有两种写法，“属于树本身的东西”，如果实、叶子等要用“on”，而“在树枝间穿梭的小动物”，如鸟、猴子等要用“in”喔！",
      "totalCount": 378
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 500408625,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_70_412-450",
      "chapterUid": 70,
      "range": "412-450",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "I am a girl.",
      "totalCount": 374
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 267737339,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_70_4403-4463",
      "chapterUid": 70,
      "range": "4403-4463",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "英文单词若开头字母是a,e,i,o,u的话，通常它的发音也会是元音开头，因此初学者可用此标准来判断是否要用an来取代a。",
      "totalCount": 360
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 216643740,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_79_1022-1082",
      "chapterUid": 79,
      "range": "1022-1082",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "every的用法：“every”=“每一个”，属于形容词。“每一个”算是单数，必须和单数名词配合，所以be动词要用is。",
      "totalCount": 345
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 85948009,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_70_2193-2230",
      "chapterUid": 70,
      "range": "2193-2230",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "初学者要先认识几个常用的代词（你、我、他），再了解必须一起搭配的be动词。",
      "totalCount": 320
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 216643740,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_116_1916-1997",
      "chapterUid": 116,
      "range": "1916-1997",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "动词过去式虽然和过去分词写法大多相同，但是过去分词只用来描述“在过去时刻，动作已经完成”，它的性质接近形容词 / 副词；而动词过去式却是真正的动词，两者不可混淆！",
      "totalCount": 304
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 38943012,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_67_738-797",
      "chapterUid": 67,
      "range": "738-797",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "笔者认为前后连贯的学习内容以及运用先前所学的基础层层积累，不断地造句翻译练习，对于身处非英语系环境的学习者，尤其重要。",
      "totalCount": 300
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 447341902,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_72_404-450",
      "chapterUid": 72,
      "range": "404-450",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "You are a short boy.",
      "totalCount": 299
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 392894885,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_85_1208-1280",
      "chapterUid": 85,
      "range": "1208-1280",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“on”这个介词=“在……上面”的意思，但是这里所说的“上面”，并不是“漂浮在东西的上空”喔，而是必须接触到东西的表面，才能使用“on”来说明！",
      "totalCount": 294
    },
    {
      "bookId": "25793956",
      "userVid": 40879360,
      "bookmarkId": "25793956_84_1885-1935",
      "chapterUid": 84,
      "range": "1885-1935",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "中文常会省略“是”，但没有了“is”，这句就失去了动词。英文句子一定要有动词，所以不能省略“is”！",
      "totalCount": 288
    }
